<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-SWEDEN CLINCH DAVIS CUP FINAL BERTH.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWEDEN CLINCH DAVIS CUP FINAL BERTH.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-09-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden clinched a place in the </p>
<p>Davis Cup final on Sunday when Thomas Enqvist beat Daniel Vaceck</p>
<p>to give them a winning 3-1 lead in their world group semifinal.</p>
<p>Results: (Czech names first)</p>
<p>Daniel Vacek lost to Thomas Enqvist 3-6 7-6 (7-3) 6-4 5-7 3-6</p>
<p>Petr Korda lost to Stefan Edberg 6-4 2-6 5-7</p>
<p>Sweden won tie 4-1.</p>
</text>
